  "body": "if we get behind on replication (eg because the connection dropped and we have to process a POSITION, which is slowish), we stack up background processes on a linearizer; bg processes are heavy (particularly with respect to prometheus metrics) and linearizers aren't terribly efficient once the queue gets long either.",
